@startuml H-民生建设监督
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · H 民生建设监督（UC-SUB-H-01 ~ H-02）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · H 民生建设监督
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "政府" as GOV
actor "消费者" as CONSUMER

rectangle "H 民生建设监督" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-H-01 公开民生项目并同步进度" as H01
  usecase "UC-SUB-H-02 回应群众意见" as H02
}

GOV --> H01
GOV --> H02
CONSUMER --> H01
CONSUMER --> H02

note bottom of H01
  发布计划/资金/工期/责任部门并公开，进度图文/视频/数据同步
end note
note bottom of H02
  群众提意见→建设方限时回应→记录公示
end note
@enduml
